      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "大家好，我是周航。",
      "start": 8.589,
      "duration": 1.611,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_002_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_002_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "周航你今天来得够早的，我刚听说科技圈出了个大新闻，NVIDIA那个CUDA护城河，被人凿穿了？",
      "start": 10.697,
      "duration": 17.695,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_003_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_003_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你消息挺灵通的。这事儿我跟你讲，真挺有意思的。NVIDIA的CUDA生态你知道吧，他们花了整整二十年，把开发者都圈在那个生态里了。",
      "start": 28.845,
      "duration": 10.947,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_004_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_004_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "我知道我知道，就是那个写GPU程序用的软件框架嘛，对吧？以前大家都觉得这个壁垒深得跟马里亚纳海沟似的。",
      "start": 40.197,
      "duration": 12.147,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_005_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_005_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对，但这次不是哪个小公司出来挑战，是AI自己来凿的。说白了，就是用AI编译器，把本来需要大量人工去移植适配的活儿给自动化了。",
      "start": 52.777,
      "duration": 11.644,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_006_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_006_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "你注意啊，这个\"10小时\"是什么概念？人家NVIDIA花了二十年垒起来的墙，AI用10小时就给找到突破口了？",
      "start": 64.886,
      "duration": 12.278,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_007_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_007_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "是这么个意思。但你要说CUDA马上要完蛋，那也不至于——毕竟现存的代码量、开发者习惯、工具链成熟度，这些都是实实在在的护城河。",
      "start": 77.626,
      "duration": 12.906,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_008_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_008_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那这次突破到底打开了什么口子？",
      "start": 90.983,
      "duration": 4.136,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_009_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_009_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "问题就在这儿。过去国产GPU也好，一些新兴架构也好，硬件参数堆得再猛，没生态就是白搭。开发者不愿意为一个新架构重写代码，成本太高。",
      "start": 95.619,
      "duration": 11.861,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_010_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_010_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "嗯，这跟苹果M1芯片出来后，大家还在Windows生态转不过来是一个道理？",
      "start": 107.918,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_011_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_011_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你这个类比还挺贴切的。现在AI编译器能自动把代码翻译到不同架构上，相当于把\"搬家\"的成本压到几乎为零。",
      "start": 114.779,
      "duration": 10.928,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_012_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_012_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那对咱们普通人有啥影响？我买显卡是不是要变天了？",
      "start": 126.152,
      "duration": 4.397,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_013_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_013_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "短期内买显卡还是看NVIDIA，但是吧——说白了，整个算力栈要重新洗牌了。以后AI芯片竞争的重点不再是单纯的硬件参数，而是谁能构建更开放的编译生态。",
      "start": 131.023,
      "duration": 14.125,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_014_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_014_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这对国产GPU来说岂不是天大的好事？",
      "start": 145.575,
      "duration": 4.397,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_015_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_015_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "没错，窗口期真的来了。但是话说回来，生态这东西不只是技术问题，开发者社区、文档、培训、案例库，这些都需要时间积累。AI编译器打开了一扇门，但门后面的路还得慢慢走。",
      "start": 150.436,
      "duration": 16.694,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_016_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_016_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "嗯，反正这事儿让我想起一句话——技术壁垒从来不是铁板一块，时间站在变革那一边。",
      "start": 167.547,
      "duration": 14.15,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_017_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_017_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "总结得挺到位的。那咱们接着聊下一个，这个更值得关注。Sand.ai开源了一个千亿参数的MoE视频生成模型。",
      "start": 182.133,
      "duration": 10.667,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_018_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_018_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这个我也看到了！114B参数，但实际激活只有6B，听着就很夸张。",
      "start": 193.217,
      "duration": 6.705,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_019_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_019_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你给我翻译翻译，什么叫MoE架构？",
      "start": 200.418,
      "duration": 4.441,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_020_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_020_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "呃……我先猜一个，是不是\"混合专家\"？意思是一个大模型里有好多专家模块，平时干活只调用其中几个？",
      "start": 205.271,
      "duration": 9.273,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_021_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_021_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "你行啊苏晴，这都知道。MoE就是这个思路，相当于平时养着一百多号人，但干活只派六个人出去，推理成本能压得很低。",
      "start": 215.023,
