      "duration": 2.395,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_023_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_023_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "能生成10秒1080P视频，成本低到0.5元。你听清楚——0.5元一条。",
      "start": 227.983,
      "duration": 8.185,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_024_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_024_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "真的假的？0.5元一条10秒1080P视频？这也太便宜了吧！以前这种级别的东西都是按秒收费闭源API的天价吧？",
      "start": 236.658,
      "duration": 15.649,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_025_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_025_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对，所以我说这是视频生成正式跨入\"开源+低成本\"时代的标志。以前这种千亿级别的视频模型，都是闭源API按秒收费的，现在直接开源给你用。",
      "start": 252.784,
      "duration": 11.015,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_026_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_026_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "那对那些做短视频、广告、影视的公司来说，生产方式要被重新定义了呀。",
      "start": 264.217,
      "duration": 7.706,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_027_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_027_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "没错，但生产范式被重塑更准确。你想啊，以前做个短视频脚本、配个画面，找外包可能几千块；现在自己跑模型，成本几乎可以忽略不计。",
      "start": 272.362,
      "duration": 12.471,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_028_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_028_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "是不是意味着以后小红书博主人人都是导演了？",
      "start": 285.245,
      "duration": 6.182,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_029_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_029_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这么说也不算夸张。但你也别高兴太早——内容产业的门槛从来不在工具，在于创意和审美。工具越平权，内容的差异化就越重要。",
