      "duration": 11.731,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_030_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_030_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "嗯，这话在理。 AI解决了\"能不能做\"的问题，但\"做得好不好\"还是得靠人。",
      "start": 304.06,
      "duration": 8.925,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_031_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_031_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "而且我跟你说，这次开源的意义不只是便宜。开源意味着整个社区都能基于它做微调、做插件、做垂直应用，生态会一下子铺开。 AI视频应用的爆发拐点是真的到了。",
      "start": 313.472,
      "duration": 15.214,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_032_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_032_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "说到工具应用， 我今天还看到一则快讯——兔展智能发了个叫RabbitVis的东西，听名字就知道跟设计有关。",
      "start": 329.128,
      "duration": 10.405,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_033_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_033_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "这个我看了，重点是AI终于能逐层编辑设计稿了。你知道吧，以前AI生成设计稿就是出一张图，你要改某个元素，等于重做整张图。",
      "start": 339.993,
      "duration": 10.449,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_034_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_034_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "啊对对对，这个痛点我太懂了！我之前用某AI工具生成海报，想换个logo位置，结果它把整张图重新生成了一遍，颜色风格全变了。",
      "start": 350.913,
      "duration": 15.475,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_035_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_035_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "对，RabbitVis就是把设计全流程打通了——AI不只是出图，还能理解图层结构、单独编辑元素。 设计师的活儿确实要被重新定义。",
      "start": 366.8,
      "duration": 12.103,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_036_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_036_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 37,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "这下设计师是不是又要紧张了？",
      "start": 379.348,
      "duration": 4.92,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_037_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_037_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_a_professional",
        "lively": "host_a_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 38,
      "host": "B",
      "text": "说实话， 初级执行层面的设计师确实会受影响，但高级设计师反而解放了——他们可以把精力放在创意和审美决策上，执行交给AI。",
      "start": 384.723,
      "duration": 12.234,
      "audios": {
        "professional": "chunk_038_professional.mp3",
        "lively": "chunk_038_lively.mp3"
      },
      "voices": {
        "professional": "host_b_professional",
        "lively": "host_b_lively"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 39,
      "host": "A",
      "text": "嗯，听上去是工具把人往更高层级推了一把。 还有一则，阿里淘天开了2027届校招，听说AI技术岗占比超过90%。",
      "start": 397.397,
      "duration": 11.407,
      "audios": {
